  m_text: "# The program should written in a proprietary declarative language.\r\n#
    Boolean values, integers, decimals, and strings enclosed in double quotes are
    treated as literals.\r\n# The returned value can be discarded by receiving it
    with an underscore.\r\n# Any text after the # symbol will be treated as a comment.\r\n#
    The following functions are available:\r\n\r\n# Game API\r\nOUT(\"MoveForward\",
    A)\r\nOUT(\"MoveBack\",A)\r\nOUT(\"MoveRight\",A)\r\nOUT(\"MoveLeft\",A)\r\nOUT(\"RotateRight\",A)\r\nOUT(\"RotateLeft\",A)\r\nX
    = KEY(\"Key name\")\r\n\r\n# Logic\r\nX = AND(A,B)\r\nX = OR(A,B)\r\nX = NOT(A)\r\nX
    = XOR(A,B)\r\nX = NAND(A,B)\r\nX = NOR(A,B)\r\nX = XNOR(A,B)\r\n\r\n# Sequence\r\nX
    = DFF(D,T)\r\nX = RSFF(R,S)\r\nX = TFF(T)\r\nX = JKFF(J,K,T)\u200B"
